WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.040
A <00:00:00.120>very <00:00:00.420>large <00:00:00.820>Oak <00:00:01.140>was <00:00:01.380>uprooted <00:00:01.820>by

00:00:02.040 --> 00:00:04.180
the <00:00:02.200>wind <00:00:02.600>and <00:00:03.000>thrown <00:00:03.260>across <00:00:03.580>a <00:00:03.780>stream.

00:00:04.840 --> 00:00:06.260
