00:00:06.260 --> 00:00:07.240
which <00:00:06.540>it <00:00:06.680>thus <00:00:06.860>addressed:

00:00:07.980 --> 00:00:08.820
I <00:00:08.100>wonder <00:00:08.260>how <00:00:08.560>you,

00:00:08.840 --> 00:00:10.100
who <00:00:09.080>are <00:00:09.180>so <00:00:09.380>light <00:00:09.600>and <00:00:09.800>weak,

00:00:10.480 --> 00:00:12.480
are <00:00:10.560>not <00:00:10.740>entirely <00:00:11.280>crushed <00:00:11.660>by <00:00:11.940>these <00:00:12.140>strong

00:00:12.480 --> 00:00:12.820
winds.

00:00:13.540 --> 00:00:15.840
They <00:00:13.740>replied, <00:00:14.580>You <00:00:14.660>fight <00:00:14.980>and <00:00:15.240>contend <00:00:15.580>with

