the <00:00:16.000>wind, <00:00:16.760>and <00:00:16.960>consequently <00:00:17.460>you <00:00:17.800>are <00:00:17.920>destroyed;

00:00:19.100 --> 00:00:20.840
while <00:00:19.320>we <00:00:19.440>on <00:00:19.560>the <00:00:19.700>contrary <00:00:20.080>bend <00:00:20.500>before

00:00:20.840 --> 00:00:22.040
the <00:00:21.020>least <00:00:21.200>breath <00:00:21.520>of <00:00:21.740>air,

00:00:22.040 --> 00:00:23.980
and <00:00:22.580>therefore <00:00:22.960>remain <00:00:23.340>unbroken,

00:00:23.980 --> 00:00:25.000
